          `turbo.json:18-20 declares \`dependsOn: ["^build"]\` so ` +
          `the workspace deps must build first; a non-zero exit ` +
          `may indicate either a unit-test regression in ` +
          `science-advantage OR a workspace-deps build failure. ` +
          `First 4 KB of output:\n${testOutput.slice(0, 4096)}`,
      ).toBe(0);
    });
